        // (func_id, arg values) in `ctx.comptime_fn_caches`. This mirrors TS
        // `helper.ts` delegating to `evaluateComptimeFunctionCall` when the
        // return is compile-time-only. Memoization gives each distinct
        // instantiation a single shared TypeValue (stable id), which both
